{"v":4,"catch":"準備迎接新一代越野體驗！","desc":"SnowRunner 帶你駕駛超猛車輛，克服由最先進地形模擬技術製成的極端開放式環境。駕駛 Ford、Chevrolet 和 Freightliner 等 40 種酷炫車款，在蠻荒地帶留下你的印記。\n\n執行危險任務，克服泥濘、急流、積雪、結冰湖泊等嚴峻環境。透過多種升級和配件 (包含分別用於克服深水和積雪的排氣管與雪鍊) 擴張和自訂你的車隊。\n\n可單人遊玩或以 4 人合作模式與其他玩家一起享受駕駛快感！\n• 挑戰高度先進物理引擎打造的極端環境\n• 可解除鎖定、升級和自訂 40 種獨特車輛\n• 完成相連世界中的數十項挑戰任務\n• 可單人遊玩或以 4 人合作模式與其他玩家共同挑戰\n\n可單人遊玩或以 4 人合作模式與其他玩家一起享受駕駛快感，透過社群創作模組豐富你的 SnowRunner 遊戲體驗！","publisher":"Focus Entertainment","release":"2026-06-11","genres":["模擬","競速"],"players":"單機 1 人 · 本機通訊 2–4 人 · 網路 1–4 人","langs":["日文","英文","葡萄牙文","西班牙文","法文","德文","義大利文","俄文","韓文","中文 (簡體)","中文 (繁體)","波蘭文"],"pmax":4,"poff":1,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 50.6GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4d888dae6d5d4397cc7eb0d5314211b7fa48502ee075973ef88fe82a9c2b1241.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/190763451c79604cee3af04346044f6e517f607e11aa42161c54466ed9e242b8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/74ab84721dc4c1e26f55118ce3a074d882c060ee2364d4d5df5e8091b60fdee4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/412de0cfb3d89e92e62e5696260dbdf958b999f8cbce93d2bc5e4dd3f647a3e1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9ff928af9f70c628e181f66a348afa097e65b3199be8669a1d9cb81b33d74ec4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4b10ce747dc71207780750643990fd050ec58684fd269c6852e67f24512009a3.jpg"],"titleId":"0400b3e026c64000","dlc":[{"id":"70050000071857","name":"SnowRunner - Derry Longhorn 4520 Sabertooth Livery","img":"68df9c703d46e141ddf9d17bd011fd3b9bd0ea8681cd2a293c9955c7234be3e3","date":"2026-06-11","mem":false},{"id":"70050000072231","name":"SnowRunner - High Roller Pack","img":"f46f2317aeb51236f4b9b3038c1b57068d8dcdb24facc935c05002540ca35c48","date":"2026-06-11","mem":false},{"id":"70050000072243","name":"SnowRunner - Loaded Dice Vinyl Wrap","img":"551344cac19e807a82c44b2b037154c2ae4b821d7d21792525087dea3ec7aff2","date":"2026-06-11","mem":false},{"id":"70050000072251","name":"SnowRunner - Scorched Vinyl Wrap","img":"44fd